    "original_instruction": "A team member posted a support escalation in our #support Slack channel. Please handle it.\n\nInstructions:\n1. Read the latest message in the #support Slack channel\n2. Based on the Slack message, find the mentioned customer account in the CRM\n3. Create a support case with the details from the Slack message:\n   - Subject: Use the issue summary from Slack\n   - Priority: As specified in the Slack message\n   - Status: Assigned\n   - Description: Include all details from the Slack message\n4. Post a reply in the #support channel confirming \"case assigned\" with the case details",
