    "agent_final_response": "\n\nI've successfully handled the support escalation from the #support Slack channel. Here's what I did:\n\n1. **Read the latest message** from #support channel - An urgent escalation from TechFlow Industries about a data synchronization failure with Sarah Miller as the contact, marked as Critical priority.\n\n2. **Found the customer account** - Located \"TechFlow Industries\" in the CRM (Account ID: bfbb60dd-c7c0-11f1-b74e-ee18f99d1ded).\n\n3. **Created a support case** with the following details:\n   - **Case Number**: #92\n   - **Subject**: Data synchronization failure\n   - **Priority**: P1 (Critical)\n   - **Status**: Open_Assigned\n   - **Account**: TechFlow Industries\n   - **Description**: Included all details from the Slack message about the 6-hour production data sync failure and losing transaction data.\n\n4. **Posted a reply** in the #support channel confirming:\n   ```\n   ✅ Case assigned\n\n   Case #92: Data synchronization failure\n   Customer: TechFlow Industries\n   Priority: Critical (P1)\n   Status: Open_Assigned\n\n   The support case has been created and is now assigned for immediate attention.\n   ```\n\nThe case is now in the system and ready for the support team to address.",
